o": "Interviewer: Tell me about your trip, Maya. Maya: On Saturday I went to a lake with my brother. We went by bus. It was sunny in the morning. We had sandwiches for lunch. Then it started raining, so we went home early. My brother was disappointed because he wanted to swim. I was happy because we saw a beautiful rainbow.", "accepted": ["bus", "Bus"], "max_points": 2}, {"word_id": "listen-3", "item_id": "listen-3", "level": "G", "kind": "meaning", "prompt": "In welchem Monat oder welcher Jahreszeit fand das Fest statt?", "audio": "This is a report from our school spring fair. It was held on Friday in the school garden. Our class sold pancakes to raise money for a local animal charity. The pupils wanted to buy decorations, but they decided to use old paper instead. This meant they could give more money to the charity. At first there were only a few visitors. Then the school band started playing, and more families arrived. By the end, all the pancakes were sold. Next year the pupils want to use a bigger table because some visitors had to wait a long time.", "accepted": ["spring", "Frühling", "Frühjahr"], "max_points": 2}, {"word_id": "listen-4", "item_id": "listen-4", "level": "G", "kind": "meaning", "prompt": "Wo fand das Schulfest statt?", "audio": "This is a report from our school spring fair. It was held on Friday in the school garden. Our class sold pancakes to raise money for a local animal charity. The pupils wanted to buy decorations, but they decided to use old paper instead. This meant they could give more money to the charity. At first there were only a few visitors. Then the school band started playing, and more families arrived. By the end, all the pancakes were sold. Next year the pupils want to use a bigger table because some visitors had to wait a long time.", "accepted": ["school garden", "Schulgarten", "im Schulgarten"], "max_points": 2}, {"word_id": "listen-5", "item_id": "listen-5", "level": "G", "kind": "meaning", "prompt": "Was verkaufte die Klasse?", "audio": "This is a report from our school spring fair. It was held on Friday in the school garden. Our class sold pancakes to raise money for a local animal charity. The pupils wanted to buy decorations, but they decided to use old paper instead. This meant they could give more money to the charity. At first there were only a few visitors. Then the school band started playing, and more families arrived. By the end, all the pancakes were sold. Next year the pupils want to use a bigger table because some visitors had to wait a long time.", "accepted": ["pancakes", "Pfannkuchen"], "max_points": 2}, {"word_id": "listen-6", "item_id": "listen-6", "level": "M", "kind": "meaning", "prompt": "Warum fuhren sie früher nach Hause?", "audio": "Interviewer: Tell me about your trip, Maya. Maya: On Saturday I went to a lake with my brother. We went by bus. It was sunny in the morning. We had sandwiches for lunch. Then it started raining, so we went home early. My brother was disappointed because he wanted to swim. I was happy because we saw a beautiful rainbow.", "accepted": ["because it started raining", "it started raining", "weil es anfing zu regnen", "weil es regnete", "Regen"], "max_points": 2}, {"word_id": "listen-7", "item_id": "listen-7", "level": "M", "kind": "meaning", "prompt": "Was wollte Mayas Bruder am See machen?", "audio": "Interviewer: Tell me about your trip, Maya. Maya: On Saturday I went to a lake with my brother. We went by bus. It was sunny in the morning. We had sandwiches for lunch. Then it started raining, so we went home early. My brother was disappointed because he wanted to swim. I was happy because we saw a beautiful rainbow.", "accepted": ["swim", "schwimmen"], "max_points": 2}, {"word_id": "listen-8", "item_id": "listen-8", "level": "M", "kind": "meaning", "prompt": "Für wen war das gesammelte Geld?", "audio": "This is a report from our school spring fair. It was held on Friday in the school garden. Our class sold pancakes to raise money for