n Regenbogen. Ihr Bruder wollte schwimmen und war enttäuscht."], "max_points": 2}, {"word_id": "listen-11", "item_id": "listen-11", "level": "E", "kind": "sentence", "prompt": "Warum war die Entscheidung für altes Papier gut für das Ziel des Festes? Antworte auf Deutsch.", "audio": "This is a report from our school spring fair. It was held on Friday in the school garden. Our class sold pancakes to raise money for a local animal charity. The pupils wanted to buy decorations, but they decided to use old paper instead. This meant they could give more money to the charity. At first there were only a few visitors. Then the school band started playing, and more families arrived. By the end, all the pancakes were sold. Next year the pupils want to use a bigger table because some visitors had to wait a long time.", "accepted": ["Sie sparten Geld für Dekorationen und konnten deshalb mehr Geld für den Tierschutz spenden.", "Weil sie weniger Geld für Dekorationen ausgaben, blieb mehr Geld für die Tierschutzorganisation übrig."], "max_points": 2}, {"word_id": "listen-12", "item_id": "listen-12", "level": "E", "kind": "sentence", "prompt": "Welches Problem soll nächstes Jahr gelöst werden und wie? Antworte auf Deutsch.", "audio": "This is a report from our school spring fair. It was held on Friday in the school garden. Our class sold pancakes to raise money for a local animal charity. The pupils wanted to buy decorations, but they decided to use old paper instead. This meant they could give more money to the charity. At first there were only a few visitors. Then the school band started playing, and more families arrived. By the end, all the pancakes were sold. Next year the pupils want to use a bigger table because some visitors had to wait a long time.", "accepted": ["Die Besucher mussten lange warten. Ein größerer Tisch soll helfen.", "Sie wollen einen größeren Tisch benutzen, damit die Besucher nicht so lange warten müssen."], "max_points": 2}]}}$j$::jsonb) ON CONFLICT(task_k